{"seq":61,"slug":"schema-evolution-data-contracts","title":"数据契约与 Schema 演进","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts","rating":{"composite":4.2,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 数据契约与 Schema 演进\n\n上游系统悄悄把一个字段从字符串改成整数，没有任何报错，pipeline 照常跑完——直到下游的模型准确率在六小时后掉了 30 个百分点。这类\"静默劣化\"在数据密集型组织中反复发生，根源不是代码 bug，而是数据生产者与消费者之间缺乏可执行的契约。数据契约（Data Contract）与 Schema 演进（Schema Evolution）正是为堵住这个缺口而生的工程实践体系。\n\n数据契约回答\"我给你的数据长什么样、保证什么质量、变了怎么通知你\"；Schema 演进回答\"数据结构要变时，如何不破坏正在消费它的系统\"。两者协同形成一个闭环：契约定义期望，兼容性规则约束变更，注册中心存储版本谱系，自动化检测在 CI/CD 阶段拦住破坏性修改。\n\n四章内容按照\"定义→演进→验证→落地\"的路径组织。\n\n第一章「基础」建立核心概念：数据契约的完整组成（schema + 质量规则 + SLA + 所有权）、主流 schema 定义格式（Avro / Protobuf / JSON Schema）的选型权衡、以及契约所有权模型如何在组织内划分生产者与消费者的责任边界。\n\n第二章「演进」深入变更管理：向后、向前、完全三种兼容性模式的精确语义与适用场景；Schema Registry 如何作为变更的门控中枢；以及当非兼容变更不可避免时，Expand-and-Contract 等迁移策略如何实现零停机过渡。\n\n第三章「验证」把契约从文档变成自动化门控：契约测试在 pipeline 中的集成方式、破坏性变更的检测算法、以及治理自动化如何将审批流程编码为可执行的策略。\n\n第四章「生产」面向真实系统：事件驱动架构中契约的应用模式、API 层与数据层契约如何对齐、以及组织级采纳的推进路径。\n\n与兄弟 hub 的分工：[流处理](../13_stream-processing/_INTRODUCTION.md) 聚焦于无界数据的计算引擎与时间语义，本 hub 聚焦于数据结构本身的契约与版本管理——流处理引擎之上跑的消息，其 schema 如何安全演进，正是本 hub 的领地。[事件溯源与 CQRS](../../09_cross-discipline/09_event-sourcing-cqrs/_INTRODUCTION.md) 关注事件存储与读写分离的架构模式，本 hub 则关注事件载荷的结构定义、兼容性策略与治理。三者互补而不重叠。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-contracts-overview","title":"数据契约全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/foundations/data-contracts-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"schema-definition-formats","title":"Schema 定义格式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/foundations/schema-definition-formats"},{"seq":3,"slug":"contract-ownership-model","title":"契约所有权模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/foundations/contract-ownership-model"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"evolution","title":"演进","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/evolution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"compatibility-rules","title":"兼容性规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/evolution/compatibility-rules"},{"seq":2,"slug":"schema-registry","title":"Schema Registry 注册中心","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/evolution/schema-registry"},{"seq":3,"slug":"migration-strategies","title":"迁移策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/evolution/migration-strategies"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"validation","title":"验证","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/validation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"contract-testing","title":"契约测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/validation/contract-testing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"breaking-change-detection","title":"破坏性变更检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/validation/breaking-change-detection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"governance-automation","title":"治理自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/validation/governance-automation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"production","title":"生产","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/production","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"event-driven-contracts","title":"事件驱动契约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/production/event-driven-contracts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"api-data-contract-alignment","title":"API 与数据契约对齐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/production/api-data-contract-alignment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"organizational-adoption","title":"组织级采纳","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/production/organizational-adoption"}]}]}